text":"ワイルドハントの穢れに染まり、身体さえもバラバラになって…あなたは今も、あの戦場から抜け出せていないんですね。あなたにとって、戦いはまだ終わっていない…","nextNodeIds":[760810304]},{"nodeId":760810304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"イルーガ","textMapHash":3662708370,"text":"その点では、僕も同じかもしれません。ワイルドハントが完全に消え去るその日まで、真の安らぎは得られない…","nextNodeIds":[760810305]},{"nodeId":760810305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"イルーガ","textMapHash":3726220058,"text":"お目にかかれて光栄です、シグルドさん。","nextNodeIds":[760810306]},{"nodeId":760810306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"イルーガ","textMapHash":625276242,"text":"分かりました。ライトキーパーにとって、最高の交流は刀を手に取り、互いに切磋琢磨することですね。","nextNodeIds":[760810307]},{"nodeId":760810307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"イルーガ","textMapHash":923877394,"text":"では、新世代のライトキーパーの腕をお見せします。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7608101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7608103,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133601403,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7608103,"order":3,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":2850130284,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7608103"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GU